    {
      "post_id": "525040097272819712",
      "text": "NO, Michael Zehaf-Bibeau was NOT wearing a GamerGate t-shirt during the Ottawa Shooting.  The people spreading this are freaking sick.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 21:44:48 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": null,
      "post_type": "source"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525050150398734336",
      "text": "@redlianak I was one of the guys he completely disrespected. He is a horrible human being.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 22:24:45 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.2504204565285274e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "525041502310117377",
      "text": "@redlianak What kind of pathetic pos uses a tragic event to bash a consumer revolt.",
      "timestamp": "Wed Oct 22 21:50:23 +0000 2014",
